# Entry `quote`, step 3: an EXPIRED code is refused. `._call.error` makes
# the call `ok: false` with this code and message; the caller decides what
# that means for its own answer. `@halt` ends the callee, never the caller.
WHEN @src == "call" && @call.entry == "quote" && @call.input.code == "EXPIRED"
  EMIT ._call.error = &object("code", "code_expired", "message", "that code has expired"),
       @halt = true
